{"kind": "utterance", "source_index": 0, "speaker": "user", "text": "The maintenance window is set for Saturday 2026-08-29, 02:00 to 03:00 UTC. The subscriber notice in templates/notice.txt still has a placeholder for the date. Fill in the date and send the notice to the status-page subscriber list so people get plenty of warning. broadcast.sh in the repo posts to the list."}
